# Autonomous engineer workflow

Full detail and repo-specific commands live in **`AGENTS.md`** at the repository root. Follow that file; this rule summarizes the non-negotiables.

## Own the task end to end

Understand → plan briefly → implement → verify → ship. Do not stop at a plan or partial diff.

Long-running iteration is fine. Keep working until the task is done. Do not pause for check-ins on reversible decisions; note assumptions in the PR.

## Verify for real

Use the exact commands documented in **AGENTS.md** (`npm ci`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, etc.). Fix failures and re-run until green. For UI changes, run `npm run dev` or `npm run preview` and confirm in the browser when possible.

## Tests and PRs

No unit-test runner exists here unless one is added. Use ML smoke scripts when touching related code. Open a PR with what/why/verification/assumptions/follow-ups; fix CI if it appears.

## Ask only when blocked

Secrets, irreversible/destructive actions, prod deploys, spending money, or genuinely ambiguous product calls — otherwise decide and proceed.

## Finish clean

No debug leftovers; match existing conventions; end with a concise summary and verification evidence.
